ANTS local hardware overlay: RTX A5500 Laptop (sm_86)
Base ASPIRE commit: fa00f0ef2bc1d91d594b9aa502c22133c9f538f7

Preserves only the hardware profile and CUDA architecture entry. No cuRobo
collision-filter changes or generated environment reports are included.
No ASPIRE fork or submodule commit change is required.

From the ANTS root, after initializing the ASPIRE submodule:
    git -C ASPIRE apply --check ../docs/patches/aspire-a5500.patch
    git -C ASPIRE apply ../docs/patches/aspire-a5500.patch

Apply once. If the check fails, inspect the checkout rather than forcing it.
To check whether this overlay is already present:
    git -C ASPIRE apply --reverse --check ../docs/patches/aspire-a5500.patch

